    },
    {
      "displayText": "糟……糟了！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŌ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 216,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7CDF202620267CDF4E86FF01001000020114014C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我和我带的泥巴鱼走散了！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŌ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 240,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211548C62115E2676846CE55DF49C7C8D7065634E86FF01001000020114014C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "啊！虽说都是泥巴鱼，\n但它是我在伽勒尔地区捉到的，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n样子是这样的。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŌ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 276,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "554AFF01867D8BF490FD662F6CE55DF49C7CFF0C000A4F465B83662F621157284F3D52D25C145730533A634952307684FF0C00100001BE00000A68375B50662F8FD9683776843002001000020114014C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "当它藏进地面的时候，\n看起来就像精灵球一样。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŌ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 360,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5F535B8385CF8FDB57309762768465F65019FF0C000A770B8D7767655C3150CF7CBE707574034E0068373002001000020114014C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你能帮我去11号野生特区\n把泥巴鱼找回来吗？<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n它一定是拟态成了精灵球的样子。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŌ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 416,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F6080FD5E2E621153BB0031003153F791CE751F7279533A000A628A6CE55DF49C7C627E56DE67655417FF1F00100001BE00000A5B834E005B9A662F62DF600162104E867CBE70757403768468375B503002001000020114014C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你要是找到我的泥巴鱼了，\n就来跟我说一声吧！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŌ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 508,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F608981662F627E5230621176846CE55DF49C7C4E86FF0C000A5C3167658DDF62118BF44E0058F05427FF01001000020114014C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 564,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你能帮我去11号野生特区\n把泥巴鱼找回来吗？<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n它一定是拟态成了精灵球的样子。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŌ",
