      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6CE5FF5E6CE5FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "它似乎想让你当它的训练家！\n请好好锻炼这只泥巴鱼吧！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŌ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 928,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5B834F3C4E4E60F38BA94F605F535B8376848BAD7EC35BB6FF01000A8BF7597D597D953B70BC8FD953EA6CE55DF49C7C5427FF01001000020114014C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你的盒子\n莫非已经满了？<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n为了泥巴鱼，\n快去整理一下盒子吧。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŌ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 992,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F60768476D25B50000A83AB975E5DF27ECF6EE14E86FF1F00100001BE01000A4E3A4E866CE55DF49C7CFF0C000A5FEB53BB657474064E004E0B76D25B5054273002001000020114014C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "很好！\n你愿意收下这只泥巴鱼对吧？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŌ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
